TEXT 32 -40 Left 2 ;Battery models: 12 V BATTERY at -18 degC with a starter load (locked rotor 0.1 s, cranking to 0.6 s) | 48 V BATTERY_BMS: EN 10 ms, pre-charge 0.3 s, 48 A load 0.5 s, short 0.8 s
TEXT 32 0 Left 1 ;Probe: V(u1:s) raw SOC, V(u1:ocv) | V(u2:fl) fault latch, V(u2:x) switch state, V(u2:pre) pre-charge, I(u2:Vsw) pack current
