TEXT 32 808 Left 2 !.model SST SW(Ron=0.1m Roff=1k Vt=0.5 Vh=-0.2)
TEXT 32 840 Left 2 !.model SLD SW(Ron=0.1m Roff=1Meg Vt=0.5 Vh=-0.2)
